---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { COMPANY } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title={`Terms of Use | ${COMPANY.name}`}
  description="Website terms of use for MODH07 LIMITED."
  path="/terms"
>
  <Navbar />
  <main id="main" class="bg-paper">
    <article class="wrap prose-page py-16 sm:py-24">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p>
        These terms are a simple outline for use of this informational website.
        They are generic and should be reviewed by a qualified adviser before
        being relied on as a complete legal document.
      </p>
      <p>Last updated: 19 August 2026.</p>

      <h2>About this website</h2>
      <p>
        This website is operated by {COMPANY.name} (Company No. {COMPANY.number}),
        registered office {COMPANY.address.line1}, {COMPANY.address.locality},
        {COMPANY.address.region}, {COMPANY.address.postcode}.
      </p>
      <p>
        The site provides general information about the company and its
        registered business activities: wholesale of fruit and vegetables, and
        retail sale of fruit and vegetables in specialised stores.
      </p>

      <h2>No offer or contract</h2>
      <p>
        Content on this website is for general information only. It is not an
        offer to sell, a price list, a product catalogue, or a commitment to
        supply. Product examples are illustrative. Availability may vary.
      </p>
      <!-- TODO: Legal review — add any sales terms, credit terms, or supply conditions if the business later publishes them. -->

      <h2>Accuracy</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to keep company information accurate, including registration
        details shown on the site. Website content may change without notice.
        We do not make guarantees about uninterrupted access to the site.
      </p>
      <!-- TODO: Legal review — consider limitation of liability wording appropriate to UK law. Do not add guarantees. -->

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The website design, text and original graphics are used for this
        company website. Images are used to illustrate fresh produce and may
        include licensed stock photography. You should not copy the site for
        commercial reuse without permission.
      </p>

      <h2>Links</h2>
      <p>
        If this website later includes links to other sites, those sites have
        their own terms and privacy practices.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact form</h2>
      <p>
        The enquiry form is not connected to a messaging service in the current
        build. Submitting it does not create a contract and does not send a
        message. Enquiries can be made by email to
        <a href={`mailto:${COMPANY.email}`}>{COMPANY.email}</a>
        or by telephone on
        <a href={COMPANY.phoneHref}>{COMPANY.phoneDisplay}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are intended to be read in the context of the laws of
        England and Wales. This statement is not a complete jurisdiction
        clause and should be reviewed before use.
      </p>
      <!-- TODO: Legal review required before treating these terms as complete or enforceable. -->

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms as the website changes. The date at the top
        of this page will be revised when that happens.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
